ewis County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, across 7 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 44% of normal in May to June and 42% in June to July. In 2026 so far, June to July sits at 45% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
